<BaseLayout title="Neurinlab" description="Keeping our thinking our own in the age of AI." lang="en" current="home">
  <section class="editorial-hero home-editorial-hero"><div class="wide-inner"><p class="editorial-kicker">Slow experiments in thinking and language for the age of AI</p><h1 class="editorial-title"><span class="desktop-headline"><span>Keeping our thinking</span><span>our own in the age of AI.</span></span><span class="mobile-headline"><span>Keeping our</span><span>thinking our own</span><span>in the age of AI.</span></span></h1><p class="editorial-copy">We use fast tools while finding ways to think for ourselves,<br />write in our own words, and express ideas with greater depth.</p><a class="square-link" href="/en/about/">About Neurinlab <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  <figure class="campaign-art"><img src="/images/leaf/leaf-everywhere.png" alt="Leaf running across iPhone, iPad, and Mac" /></figure>
  <section class="leaf-intro-band"><div class="wide-inner split-editorial-grid"><p class="section-label">Leaf</p><div><h2>Turn passing thoughts<br />into usable structure.</h2><a class="text-link" href="/en/leaf/">Explore Leaf <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="gradient-statement"><div class="wide-inner split-editorial-grid"><h2>When fast results<br />blur your thinking</h2><p>AI helps us write, create, and organize faster.<br />But speed can make it harder to hear what we actually think.<br />Neurinlab asks how we can use AI without losing our own thoughts and words.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
